---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — HaikaiTech" description="Privacy Policy for HaikaiTech Solutions, a Malaysian sole proprietorship.">
  <main class="min-h-screen font-sans bg-paper bg-grid-pattern">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to home</a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600 space-y-6">
        <p>HaikaiTech Solutions ("we", "our", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you use our website haikaitech.my.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Booking data:</strong> When you book a call via Cal.com, we collect your name, email address, and phone number.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Google Analytics collects anonymised browsing data (pages visited, time on site, referral source).</li>
          <li><strong>Communications:</strong> When you contact us via WhatsApp or email, we retain the conversation history.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>To respond to inquiries and schedule consultations</li>
          <li>To provide and manage freelance services</li>
          <li>To improve our website and services (aggregated analytics only)</li>
          <li>To comply with legal and regulatory obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services that process your data:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Cal.com</strong> — booking scheduling (name, email, phone)</li>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — anonymised usage analytics</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting and CDN</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp</strong> — business communications</li>
          <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payment processing (handled on Stripe's platform)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Each service operates under its own privacy policy and data processing agreement.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain personal data only as long as necessary to provide services or comply with legal obligations. Booking and communications data are retained for 24 months after the last contact unless a longer retention is legally required.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Your Rights (PDPA Malaysia)</h2>
        <p>Under the Personal Data Protection Act 2010, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal retention obligations)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hq@haikaitech.my" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hq@haikaitech.my</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Contact</h2>
        <p>HaikaiTech Solutions<br>2-U, Jalan Sultan Azlan Shah, Bandar Bayan Baru, 11950 Bayan Lepas, Pulau Pinang, Malaysia<br>Email: <a href="mailto:hq@haikaitech.my" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hq@haikaitech.my</a><br>SSM: 202603149868 (CA0422517-K)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
